{"version":1,"content":"<p>秋天乾燥，中醫稱為「秋燥當令」，易耗傷人體的氣與陰津。</p><p>但各人體質有異，並非人人都適合同一類調養湯水，調理不當反增身體負擔。</p><p>請來中醫師按氣虛、陽虛、陰虛、痰濕、濕熱、氣鬱、平和7種體質，介紹秋季合適的食療湯水。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;-----</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T09:22:08.319285+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T09:00:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T09:18:12.281634+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T09:18:12.281634+00:00","content_hash":"16de0f58f8886f8a3b2052c2a036689869ad4234b8d1cd321d404f906775def6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}